      "context_excerpt": "This round, NVIDIA submitted results in the available category using the GB300 NVL72 rack-scale system, the first-ever MLPerf submissions using the Blackwell Ultra architecture . Blackwell Ultra builds upon the many advances in the NVIDIA Blackwell architecture, with several key enhancements:",
